# Supabase Configuration (Optional for Cloud DB connection)
# AVTOBOZOR.UZ works 100% out-of-the-box in Demo Mode with persistent local storage
# To connect your own Supabase project:
# 1. Run supabase_schema.sql in your Supabase SQL editor
# 2. Paste your project URL and Anon key below
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
